    {
      "number": 17,
      "id": "PR_kwDOU6xPE88AAAABL2etZQ",
      "title": "Remove CLOCK_ID text left over from before #4",
      "url": "https://github.com/afrind/draft-frindell-moq-timestamp/pull/17",
      "state": "MERGED",
      "author": "afrind",
      "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Since #4, an absent CLOCK_ID means POSIX time and any present value is a shared clock unrelated to wall-clock time.\n\n- Drop \"non-zero\" from the CLOCK_ID definition; 0 is an ordinary value.\n- Fix the IANA entry, which still said 0 meant wall-clock time.\n- Remove CLOCK_ID = 0 from the wall-clock examples.\n- Drop the on-demand option of omitting CLOCK_ID and TIMESTAMP_ORIGIN, which now places content at 1970; keep the shared Clock ID option.\n\nFixes #12",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-30T19:58:32Z",
      "updatedAt": "2026-10-31T12:57:12Z",
      "baseRepository": "afrind/draft-frindell-moq-timestamp",
