    {
      "number": 19,
      "id": "PR_kwDOU6xPE88AAAABL2jfTA",
      "title": "Define CLOCK_ID 1 as TAI and reserve 0-63",
      "url": "https://github.com/afrind/draft-frindell-moq-timestamp/pull/19",
      "state": "MERGED",
      "author": "afrind",
      "authorAssociation": "OWNER",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "Reserve CLOCK_ID values 0 through 63 for clocks listed in a new \"MOQ Clock IDs\" IANA registry (Specification Required), and register 1 as International Atomic Time measured from 1970-01-01T00:00:00 TAI, so Tracks such as MPEG-2 TS emission times can carry a continuous time scale without leap seconds.\n\nFixes #10",
